==Russian==
{{wp|ru:}}
[[File:Armoracia rusticana001.jpg|thumbnail|{{lang|ru|Хрен}} (1)|upright=1.15]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|хрѣнъ||ru-PRO}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-хрен.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-хрен.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|orv|хрѣнъ}}?, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*xrěnъ|t=horseradish}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|adj=хрено́вый|gen_sg=хре́на,хрена́*|notes=* See usage notes.}}

# {{C|ru|Crucifers|Spices and herbs|Male people}} [[horseradish]] {{gloss|plant, condiment}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1842|author=w:ru:Николай Гоголь<t:{{w|Nikolai Gogol}}>|title=w:ru:Мёртвые души|chapter=[[s:ru:Мёртвые_души_(Гоголь)/Том_I/Глава_IV|Том I, Глава IV]]|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:en:Constance Garnett|title2=s:en:[[Dead_Souls—A_Poem/Book_One/Chapter_IV|Dead Souls]]|location2=London|publisher2=Chatto & Windus|year2=1922|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=Поросё́нок есть? — с таки́м вопро́сом обрати́лся Чи́чиков к стоя́вшей ба́бе.<br>— Есть.<br>— С '''хре́ном''' и со смета́ною?<br>— С '''хре́ном''' и со смета́ною.<br>— Дава́й его́ сюда́!|t='Have you any sucking-pig?' was the question Tchitchikov addressed to the woman.<br>'Yes, we have.'<br>'With '''horse-radish''' and sour cream?'<br>'Yes, with '''horse-radish''' and sour cream.'<br>'Let me have some!'}}

=====Declension=====
{{ru-noun-table}}

===Etymology 2===
Euphemistic alteration of {{m|ru|хуй|pos=a vulgar curse}} or {{m|ru|хер|pos=a less vulgar version}}, influenced by the noun {{m|ru|хрен|t=horseradish}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|a=ia|adj=хрено́вый}}

# {{lb|ru|inanimate|minced oath|colloquial}} {{cln|ru|minced oaths}} [[prick]] {{gloss|penis}}; {{ng|used as a general curse and {{glossary|intensifier}}}}: [[crap]], [[hell]], [[nuts]]
#: {{syn|ru|хуй|q1=vulgar|хер|q2=vulgar|шиш|q3=euphemism|фиг|q4=euphemism}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ни|Ни]] '''хрена́''' [[не]] [[понимать|понима́ю]], [[как]] [[этот|э́то]] [[собра́ть]].|q=note the stress|I understand '''bugger-all''' about how to put this together.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[какой|Како́го]] '''хре́на''' [[он]] [[прийти|пришёл]]?|q=note the stress|What the '''hell''' did he come for?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Хре́н''' [[тебе́]]!|q=note the stress|'''Nuts''' to you!}}
# {{lb|ru|animate|pejorative|colloquial}}  [[prick]], [[asshole]] {{gloss|a term of contempt for a man}}
# {{lb|ru|animate|pejorative|colloquial}} [[old fart]]
#: {{syn|ru|хрыч|ста́рый хрыч}}

=====Usage notes=====
* When used in the expressions {{m|ru|ни хрена́}} and {{m|ru|до хрена́}}, the last syllable should be stressed.

=====Declension=====
{{ru-noun-table|a=ia|gen_sg=хре́на,хрена́*|notes=* See usage notes.}}

